/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">护理；（军队）护士</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207054\">その<ruby>病人<rp>(</rp><rt>びょうにん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>最上<rp>(</rp><rt>さいじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>看護<rp>(</rp><rt>かんご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>受<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">病人得到了最高的护理。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">換算</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんさん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">换算；转换；兑换；折算</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"97483\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でもお<ruby>金<rp>(</rp><rt>かね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>換算<rp>(</rp><rt>かんさん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してしまう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他把一切都换成金钱。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">監視</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">监视；监看；观察；监控；看守；监督</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"173009\"><ruby>国連<rp>(</rp><rt>こくれん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>国<rp>(</rp><rt>くに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>選挙<rp>(</rp><rt>せんきょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>監視<rp>(</rp><rt>かんし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">联合国对该国的选举进行了监督。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">慣習</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんしゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">习俗；惯例；常规；习以为常；逐渐适应</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211595\">その<ruby>慣習<rp>(</rp><rt>かんしゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>守<rp>(</rp><rt>まも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らなくてはならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这种习惯必须遵守。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">観衆</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんしゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">观众；旁观者</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"213042\">そのショーは<ruby>観衆<rp>(</rp><rt>かんしゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>楽<rp>(</rp><rt>たの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しいものであった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个节目对观众来说很有趣。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">干渉</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんしょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">干涉；介入；干预</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"82262\"><ruby>僕<rp>(</rp><rt>ぼく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のことに<ruby>干渉<rp>(</rp><rt>かんしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しないでくれ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不要干涉我。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">感触</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんしょく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><spa