ass=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">干线；主干线</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">感染</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんせん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">感染；传染；被感染；受感染；受影响；被不良思想所感染</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217937\">これらの<ruby>感染<rp>(</rp><rt>かんせん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>病<rp>(</rp><rt>やまい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はミルクの<ruby>汚染<rp>(</rp><rt>おせん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>原因<rp>(</rp><rt>げんいん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这些感染是由牛奶污染引起的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">関税</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんぜい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">关税；进口税；关税税率</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223891\">このカメラには<ruby>関税<rp>(</rp><rt>かんぜい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がかかります。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">摄像机将收取关税。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">簡素</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんそ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">简朴；朴素；简约</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"209672\">その<ruby>式典<rp>(</rp><rt>しきてん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>簡素<rp>(</rp><rt>かんそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">仪式很简单。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">観点</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんてん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">观点；视点；立场；角度</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"105597\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>違<rp>(</rp><rt>ちが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った<ruby>観点<rp>(</rp><rt>かんてん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るようになった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他开始从不同的角度看我。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">感度</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんど</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">灵敏度；接收灵敏度（如收音机、电视等）；感光度</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">カンニング</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">考试作弊；夹带作弊</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"166187\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちはみな<ruby>試験<rp>(</rp><rt>しけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でカンニングをすることは<ruby>悪<rp>(</rp><rt>わる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いと<ruby>考<rp>(</rp><rt>かんが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们都认为在考试中做康宁是错误的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">幹部</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんぶ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">管理层；领导层；干部；高层领导；上层领导</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"112371\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>について<ruby>幹部<rp>(</rp><rt>かんぶ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>何人<rp>(</rp><rt>なんにん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かと<ruby>協議<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他就这个问题与几个领导人进行了讨论。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">勘弁</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんべん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">原谅；宽恕；容忍</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"205796\">それだけは<ruby>勘弁<rp>(</rp><rt>かんべん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请把这一点解释一下。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">完璧</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんぺき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">完美；完善；无缺陷</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222903\">この<ruby>英作文<rp>(</rp><rt>えいさくぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>決<rp>(</rp><rt>けっ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>完璧<rp>(</rp><rt>かんぺき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ではない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这篇英语作文离完美还差得远。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/510879\" title=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">感無量</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんむりょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">深深的感动；感慨万千</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">勧誘</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんゆう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">邀请；劝诱；游说；诱导；劝说；鼓励</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"174445\"><ruby>顧客<rp>(</rp><rt>こきゃく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>対<rp>(</rp><rt>たい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する<ruby>勧誘<rp>(</rp><rt>かんゆう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>電話<rp>(</rp><rt>でんわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が、テレマーケティング<ruby>部<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>主要業務<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅようぎょうむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">向客户发送邀请电话是电信营销部门的主要业务。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">関与</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんよ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">参与；参加；涉及</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225195\">ゲンドウがこの<ruby>件<rp>(</rp><rt>けん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>関与<rp>(</rp><rt>かんよ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>していたとしても<ruby>不思議<rp>(</rp><rt>ふしぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ではない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">即使Gendou参与了这件事,也不奇怪。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">寛容</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">宽容；思想开明；忍耐；慷慨；宽宏大量</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">慣用</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">习惯用法；常用法；通常用法</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">観覧</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんらん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">观看；观览</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">官僚</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんりょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">官僚；政府官员；官僚制度</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">慣例</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんれい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">习俗；惯例；常规；先例</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">還暦</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんれき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">还历；六十大寿（传统虚岁算法中为六十一岁，即完成一个干支纪年循环）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">貫禄</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんろく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">气度；风度；威严；肥胖；臃肿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"177393\"><ruby>君<rp>(</rp><rt>きみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>課長<rp>(</rp><rt>かちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>としての<ruby>貫禄<rp>(</rp><rt>かんろく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がないね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你没有作为主持人做过什么。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">緩和</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんわ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">缓解；缓和；减轻；放宽（限制、紧张局势等）；松弛；软化</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">カーペット</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">地毯</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223917\">このカーペットは<ruby>実<rp>(</rp><rt>じつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にお<ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>得<rp>(</rp><rt>どく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个地毯真的买得好。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">街</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">がい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">街道；街区；地区；区域</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224285\">ここは<ruby>東京<rp>(</rp><rt>とうきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のビジネス<ruby>街<rp>(</rp><rt>がい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这是东京的商业街。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">外貨</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">がいか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">外币；外汇；外国汇兑；外国商品；进口商品</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"200971\">どこで<ruby>外貨<rp>(</rp><rt>がいか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>交換<rp>(</rp><rt>こうかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をすることができますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我可以在哪里交换外汇?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">外観</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">がいかん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">外观；外表；外貌；看起来的样子</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"79856\"><ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、その<ruby>本質<rp>(</rp><rt>ほんしつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>よりもむしろ<ruby>外観<rp>(</rp><rt>がいかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">问题在于它的本质而不是外观。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">外相</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">がいしょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">外交部长；外相</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">害する</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">がいする</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅲ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅲ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">伤害；损害；危害；杀死；致死；阻碍；妨碍；阻挠</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"189971\"><ruby>飲<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みすぎると<ruby>健康<rp>(</rp><rt>けんこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>害<rp>(</rp><rt>がい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">喝太多,会伤害你的健康。</span></div></li>"]